{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Magma Geode is a ",["l","矿物","Mineral"]," deposit that contains ",["l","矿物","minerals"],", ",["l","古物","artifacts"],", ores, or basic resources. It can be found on levels 81 to 119 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," or in ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"],". It can also be received as a gift at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". It may be additionally be found by breaking boxes and barrels in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". Five Magma Geodes may be produced by ",["l","岩浆鳗鱼","Lava Eel"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," containing at least 9 fish, and 10 Magma Geodes may be produced in a pond containing 10 fish. Magma Geodes can also be obtained by pickaxing ",["l","采矿#Magma Geode Node","Magma Geode Nodes"],". These are found in the small quarry on the ",["l","农场地图#Hilltop","Hill-top Farm"]," and ",["l","农场地图#Four Corners","Four Corners Farm"],". Magma Geodes may also drop from a ",["l","铁路#Trains","train"],"."]],["p",["The Magma Geode can be broken open by ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," in the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith shop"]," for 25g or by using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]],["p",["Neither daily ",["l","运气","luck"]," nor luck ",["l","效果","buffs"]," affect the contents of a Magma Geode."]]]],["Magma Geode Contents",2,[]],["Artifacts",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Dwarf_Gadget.png",24]],[["l","矮人小工具","Dwarf Gadget"]],["1/26"]]]]]],["Foraged Minerals",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Fire_Quartz.png",24]],[["l","火水晶","Fire Quartz"]],["1/16"]]]]]],["Geode Minerals",3,[["p",["All Geode Minerals have a 1/26 chance to appear."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]}],[[["f","Baryte.png",24]],[["l","重晶石","Baryte"]]],[[["f","Basalt.png",24]],[["l","玄武岩","Basalt"]]],[[["f","Bixite.png",24]],[["l","黑方石","Bixite"]]],[[["f","Dolomite.png",24]],[["l","白云石","Dolomite"]]],[[["f","Fire_Opal.png",24]],[["l","赤红猫眼石","Fire Opal"]]],[[["f","Helvite.png",24]],[["l","日光榴石","Helvite"]]],[[["f","Jasper.png",24]],[["l","碧玉","Jasper"]]],[[["f","Lemon_Stone.png",24]],[["l","柠檬石","Lemon Stone"]]],[[["f","Neptunite.png",24]],[["l","柱星叶石","Neptunite"]]],[[["f","Obsidian.png",24]],[["l","黑曜石","Obsidian"]]],[[["f","Star_Shards.png",24]],[["l","陶瓷碎片","Star Shards"]]],[[["f","Tigerseye.png",24]],[["l","虎眼石","Tigerseye"]]]]]]],["Resources",3,[["p",["Coal, copper ore, iron ore, and gold ore will be obtained in the following amounts: 30% for 1, 30% for 3, 30% for 5, 9% for 10, and 1% for 20. Stone has a 50% chance to use those values and a 50% chance to give only 1. Iridium Ore has a 30% chance for 1, 30% for 2, 30% for 3, 9% for 6, and 1% for 11. Only 1 clay can be obtained from a single geode."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Probability"]}],[[["f","Stone.png",24]],[["l","石头","Stone"]],["1/8"]],[[["f","Clay.png",24]],[["l","粘土","Clay"]],["1/16"]],[[["f","Coal.png",24]],[["l","煤炭","Coal"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Copper_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铜矿石","Copper Ore"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Iron_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铁矿石","Iron Ore"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Gold_Ore.png",24]],[["l","黄金矿石","Gold Ore"]],["1/20"]],[[["f","Iridium_Ore.png",24]],[["l","铱矿石","Iridium Ore"]],["1/20"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Magma Geode is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Red Hoodie"],". ",["f","Shirt162.png",24]," It can also be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as a red dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"]," and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Three Magma Geodes may be requested by the Raccoon at the ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Giant Stump"]," as part of his fifth request, or as part of any request starting with the sixth."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be produced by ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": May now be requested by the Raccoon."]]]]]]]}